5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. It is so lovely that we are doing this together. I hope we can find a layout that brings us all closer.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should be methodical. Let's identify the constraints and the history of this office before we start suggesting where people should sit.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It would be good to know the facts first. I don't want us to make a mistake that's hard to fix.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited! Let's make it a place where we can all be happy! I want to know how it actually feels to work there every day.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not get too sentimental. We need data on the physical environment and the actual costs of moving things around.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I am curious about how we interact. I'll look into the two project strands within earshot last spring and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the drawn plan against the staff survey and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year to see where the friction lies.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll check the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I want to know about the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the arrival times in the badge records!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
