26,2,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Shizue,,It seems that sitting close really helps us learn from one another. The new joiners felt they picked up so much just by overhearing us.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The data is concerning. There is a significant disparity in window access, and past shuffles have caused weeks of disruption to our work.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found out that we are billed for the area, not the people. Also, re-running power for each desk is quite expensive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found out that setting up every morning takes a while! And we all arrive at such different times, some very early and some late.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"As I suspected, the room is noisy near the door, and our equipment takes days of fine-tuning to actually be comfortable for the body.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, if the shuffles were so disruptive, perhaps we should look for a more permanent solution this time?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Precisely. But we must also address the window issue. If we don't decide who gets the light, it will just be a source of resentment.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, if we move things too often, the facilities costs will add up. We have to be very careful with the budget.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, that's true! But if we have to plug everything in every day, that's a different kind of cost in our time!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, time is one thing, but physical strain is another. If we move constantly, we can never settle our workstations properly.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"It sounds like we are all worried about different things, but we all want a place where we can work peacefully.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"We need a balance. We need stability to avoid costs and disruption, but we need a fair way to handle the less desirable spots.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just hope we don't spend more than we have. The floor billing is already quite high for the space we use.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Mio,,I agree! We need something that doesn't eat up our mornings or our budget. Let's find a way to stay close and efficient!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Efficiency is a buzzword. I'm talking about not having a sore back and not being distracted by the printer all day.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
